Source-reviewed orchestration. Nested semantics remain open; no runtime acceptance
claimed. Factorization compares IDs, not full reference bytes. Simple identical-child runs
remain for a separate run-encoding layer. This routine emits repeated block references,
not a compressed run field. Recursion, allocator behavior and callback side effects need
